--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -9,6 +9,16 @@ pnpm install && pnpm run start
 
 The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 
+Visited content views retain their DOM and hydrated islands in a persistent Astro
+container. Inactive views are hidden and inert; the five most recently used views
+are kept in memory. Cache keys include the path and query string, while hash
+navigation and history scroll restoration remain handled by Astro. Navigation
+still fetches the destination to update its head and route metadata. Reloading
+the document clears the cache. Form navigations invalidate it, and account pages
+opt out with `<Layout cacheView={false}>` so entered credentials are discarded.
+
+Run `pnpm test` for DOM cache tests and `pnpm build` for the production build.
+
 ## Tech Stack
 
 - **[Astro](https://astro.build/)**: The web framework for building content-driven websites.
